<title>UK: Walt Disney sets $300 million bond.</title>
<headline>Walt Disney sets $300 million bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Nomura (books) and Citibank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WALT DISNEY CO</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    21.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.794   PAY DATE   L21.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.819    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.975     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
